      "text": [
        "3737 - وَ قَالَ رَسُولُ اَللَّهِ صَلَّى اَللَّهُ عَلَيْهِ وَ آلِهِ : \"إِنَّ اَللَّهَ تَبَارَكَ وَ تَعَالَى يُحِبُّ اَلْعَبْدَ يَكُونُ سَهْلَ اَلْبَيْعِ سَهْلَ اَلشِّرَاءِ سَهْلَ اَلْقَضَاءِ سَهْلَ اَلاِقْتِضَاءِ\"."
      ],
      "translations": {
        "en.bab-ul-qaim-publications": [
          "Hadith.3737 - The Messenger of Allah (swt) (peace be upon him and his family) said:\n\"Indeed, Allah (swt), the Blessed and Exalted, loves a servant who is easygoing in selling, easygoing in buying, easygoing in settling debts, and easygoing in demanding repayment.\""
        ]
      }
